From: Xiaomi Mi MIX Linux port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: xiaomi-lithium: add the flash LED

The dual-tone flash on PMI8994 SID 3 at 0xd300 (stock qcom,leds@d300),
exposed as the "white:torch" flashlight.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-lithium.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-lithium.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-lithium.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-lithium.dts
@@ -1179,3 +1179,12 @@
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+/* Flash LED block of PMI8994 (SID 3, stock qcom,leds@d300): dual-tone flash, used as the torch */
+&{/soc@0/spmi@400f000/pmic@3} {
+	flash-led@d300 {
+		compatible = "qcom,pmi8994-flash-led";
+		reg = <0xd300>;
+		label = "white:torch";
+	};
+};
